    44	(GGV Cor 6.6, verified in refs/) and max(d,e) >= 3, so D_min >= 102 for
    45	every noninvertible Keller map and D_min has a divisor K with
    46	16 <= K <= D_min/3 (which excludes 101, 103, 106, 107, 109, 113, 118 in
    47	[101, 120]; Moh's surviving degree pairs have exactly this shape).
    48	**RETYPED — the satellite price is ONE-WAY:** T_ext <= tau on a
    49	degree-minimal representative in an H2 cell with one dicritical
    50	(W <= 3) gives D_min <= 2(tau + N) (HALF-CAP + DEG-SPLIT), so
    51	tau <= 50 − N contradicts Moh; the converse is refuted. The producer's
    52	own floor T >= D_min/2 − kappa >= 51 − N sits one unit above the target.
    53	Newton-polygon theory leaves T free: T is the continuant data of the
    54	satellite chains — the PUISEUX CHARACTERISTIC at infinity — and GGV's
    55	corner theory constrains only the first corner (u >= 4, v <= u(u − 1),
    56	u + v >= 16).
    57	
    58	## B. Records (not promoted)
    59	
    60	`sing-witness-gpt55-20260902` (34f9b423): a non-Keller, non-étale
    61	witness at N = 6 with singular A_F (cusp U^2 = V^{2k+1}) and g_L → ∞;
    62	the bounded-pair version is moot by MF-EXACT (bounded n ⇔ bounded g_L
