+(x, y+x^4)             4      1          3  [4]           1
+(x, xy^2)              3      3          0  [1,1,1]       2
+psi_2 o (x,xy^2)       6      3          3  [1,1,4]       2
+(x^3, y^2)             3      1          2  [3]           6
+```
